+// CFG block, so a function with very deep control flow (large game shaders)
+// overflowed even a 32 MiB host thread stack while serializing the module in
+// Function::dump.  An explicit stack removes the dependence on native stack
+// depth.  Semantics (visit order, delaying of merge/continue blocks, and the
+// ReachReason values) are preserved.
 class ReadableOrderTraverser {
